{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'/>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'/>
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfcfd;--panel:#ffffff;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#2563eb;--accent-2:#7c3aed;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#0f172a;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f7fafc)}
    header{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(37,99,235,0.08),rgba(124,58,237,0.06));backdrop-filter:blur(6px);padding:18px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;font-weight:600}
    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .hero{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:28px;background:var(--panel);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(12,16,24,0.06);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:22px}
    .intro h1{margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:20px;color:#08112a}
    .intro p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}
    .card{padding:16px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--glass),rgba(255,255,255,0.9));box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}
    .mood-select{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    select{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6eefc}
    .cta{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}
    .btn.alt{background:transparent;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 20px}
    section{margin-bottom:20px}
    .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px}
    .bio p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .accordion{border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #edf2ff}
    .acc-item{border-bottom:1px solid #f1f5f9}
    .acc-head{background:#fff;padding:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;cursor:pointer}
    .acc-body{padding:14px;background:#fbfdff;color:var(--muted);display:none}
    footer{max-width:980px;margin:30px auto;padding:18px;color:var(--muted)}
    .pattern{position:fixed;right:0;bottom:0;opacity:0.06;width:320px;height:320px;pointer-events:none}
    @media(max-width:900px){.hero,.two{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.pattern{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class='brand'>
      <div class='logo' aria-hidden='true'>PT</div>
      <div>
        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Therapy practice • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label='Primary navigation'>
      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
      <a href='about.html' style='color:#0f172a'>About</a>
      <a href='specialties.html'>Areas</a>
      <a href='approach.html'>Method</a>
      <a href='fees.html'>Investment</a>
      <a href='book.html'>Book</a>
      <a href='contact.html'>Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <div class='hero'>
    <div class='intro'>
      <h1>Hello — I'm a clinician here to help you find steady ways forward</h1>
      <p>I offer short series and focused sessions designed for people balancing life responsibilities who want practical, confidential support. My work combines listening, skills practice, and reflective exploration to help with decision points, transitions, and recurring patterns.</p>
      <div style='margin-top:14px;color:var(--meta);font-size:13px'>I see individuals and couples. Virtual sessions available across {{STATE}}.</div>
    </div>

    <aside class='card'>
      <div style='font-weight:700'>See what might fit right now</div>
      <div class='mood-select' style='margin-top:10px'>
        <label style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>Choose how you're feeling</label>
        <select id='mood' aria-label='Mood to method selector'>
          <option value='calm'>Calm but curious</option>
          <option value='overwhelmed'>Overwhelmed</option>
          <option value='stuck'>Stuck in a cycle</option>
          <option value='grieving'>Working through loss</option>
          <option value='anxious'>Worry and tension</option>
          <option value='avoidant'>Avoiding difficult things</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div style='margin-top:12px' aria-live='polite' id='recommend'>Recommended: Short focused series — skill and reflection</div>
      <div class='cta'>
        <a id='primaryCta' class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <a class='btn alt' href='contact.html'>Ask a question</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <main>
    <section class='two'>
      <div class='bio card'>
        <h2>About the clinician</h2>
        <p>I work with adults who want practical tools and respectful reflection. My practice centers on noticing patterns, building tolerable change, and clarifying values as a way to move toward decisions that fit your life. I use evidence-informed techniques and tailor them to the problem at hand — whether that looks like a short block of sessions or a series over time.</p>
        <p style='margin-top:8px'>I hold confidentiality seriously: sessions are private within the bounds of the law. I will review limits to confidentiality with you before we begin. I do not provide emergency services or crisis management in the moment.</p>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class='card'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Practical details</div>
          <div class='meta' style='margin-top:8px'>Phone: {{PHONE}}</div>
          <div class='meta'>Email: {{EMAIL}}</div>
          <div class='meta' style='margin-top:12px'>Sessions: 45–55 minutes • Telehealth available</div>
        </div>

        <div style='height:12px'></div>

        <div class='card accordion' id='confAcc'>
          <div class='acc-item'>
            <div class='acc-head' data-idx='0'>
              <div>Session boundaries & confidentiality</div>
              <div aria-hidden='true'>+</div>
            </div>
            <div class='acc-body'>
              <p>I keep records that are necessary for clinical care and billing. I will discuss confidentiality, record-keeping, and the limited circumstances when I must share information (for example, when there is imminent risk of harm to you or others, or when required by law). We will review this at intake, and you can ask questions anytime.</p>
              <p style='margin-top:8px'>If you are experiencing an emergency or immediate danger, this practice is not a crisis service. Please call your local emergency number or, if in the United States, the 988 Lifeline for immediate support.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>

    </section>

    <section class='card'>
      <h3>How I structure work</h3>
      <p class='meta'>I offer focused series (4–8 sessions) and single-session intensives for a targeted topic. Series are framed around an agreed goal and include collaborative homework when helpful. Pricing and scheduling details are on the Investment page.</p>
    </section>

    <section class='card'>
      <h3>Professional note</h3>
      <p class='meta'>I maintain clear boundaries around session length, fees, and cancellations. I will present a written agreement that outlines scope of care, confidentiality, and contact expectations. If care needs fall outside my scope, I will discuss referrals and coordinate with other providers with your permission.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style='font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)'>If you are in immediate danger, call emergency services. For urgent emotional support in the United States, consider dialing 988. Contact is for scheduling and questions only; clinical matters are handled in session.</div>
  </footer>

  <svg class='pattern' viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' aria-hidden='true'>
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id='g' x1='0' x2='1'>
        <stop offset='0' stop-color='#7c3aed'/>
        <stop offset='1' stop-color='#2563eb'/>
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <rect width='200' height='200' fill='url(#g)' opacity='0.06' rx='18'/>
    <g fill='white' opacity='0.05'>
      <circle cx='40' cy='40' r='6'/>
      <circle cx='80' cy='60' r='10'/>
      <circle cx='140' cy='120' r='8'/>
      <rect x='20' y='120' width='28' height='28' rx='6'/>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <script>
    (function(){
      var recommend = document.getElementById('recommend');
      var mood = document.getElementById('mood');
      var cta = document.getElementById('primaryCta');
      var map = {
        'calm':{text:'Recommended: Gentle exploration — a short series to clarify goals',cta:'Start a short series'},
        'overwhelmed':{text:'Recommended: Skill-focused blocks to ease overwhelm',cta:'Book a skills block'},
        'stuck':{text:'Recommended: Pattern work to open stuck cycles — collaborative and paced',cta:'Plan a focused series'},
        'grieving':{text:'Recommended: Hold-and-meaning sessions that create space for loss',cta:'Schedule a supportive session'},
        'anxious':{text:'Recommended: Practical strategies for managing worry and tension',cta:'Try a breathing-informed session'},
        'avoidant':{text:'Recommended: Gentle pacing to approach hard topics safely',cta:'Request a gentle intake'}
      };
      function update(){
        var v = mood.value;
        var m = map[v]||map['calm'];
        recommend.textContent = m.text;
        cta.textContent = m.cta + ' — ' + '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
        // add a query flag to the booking link so messages carry context
        try{var url = new URL('{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}', window.location.href); url.searchParams.set('mood', v); cta.setAttribute('href', url.toString());}catch(e){c.setAttribute('href','{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}');}
      }
      mood.addEventListener('change', update);
      update();

      // Simple accordion
      document.querySelectorAll('.acc-head').forEach(function(h){
        h.addEventListener('click',function(){
          var body = h.nextElementSibling;
          var open = body.style.display === 'block';
          document.querySelectorAll('.acc-body').forEach(function(b){b.style.display='none'});
          document.querySelectorAll('.acc-head div[aria-hidden]').forEach(function(x){x.textContent='+'});
          if(!open){ body.style.display='block'; h.querySelector('[aria-hidden]').textContent='-'; }
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"specialties.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'/>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'/>
  <title>Areas of Focus — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fff;--panel:#ffffff;--muted:#475569;--accent:#0ea5a4;--accent-2:#2563eb}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfbff,#ffffff);color:#0b1220}
    header{padding:14px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff}
    .logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:26px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:20px}
    .list{display:grid;gap:12px}
    .spec{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #f1f5f9}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .mood-mini{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}
    .pill{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #eef2ff;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}
    .recommend{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fbff,#ffffff);border:1px dashed #e6f0ff}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent-2);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .accordion{margin-top:16px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #eef2ff}
    .acc-head{padding:12px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #f8fafc;cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
    .acc-body{padding:12px;display:none;color:var(--muted)}
    footer{max-width:980px;margin:26px auto;padding:0 20px;color:var(--muted)}
    @media(max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pill{flex:1}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>
      <div class='logo' aria-hidden='true'>SF</div>
      <div>
        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label='Primary navigation'>
      <a href='index.html'>Start</a>
      <a href='about.html'>Who I Am</a>
      <a href='specialties.html' style='color:#0b1220;font-weight:700'>Areas</a>
      <a href='approach.html'>Method</a>
      <a href='faq.html'>FAQ</a>
      <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h1>Areas of focus</h1>
    <p class='muted'>I tend to structure work around a clear, time-limited aim when helpful. Below are common areas people bring; feel free to reach out if yours isn't listed.</p>

    <div class='grid' style='margin-top:18px'>
      <div>
        <div class='list'>
          <div class='spec'>
            <strong>Relationship navigation</strong>
            <p class='muted'>Communication patterns, transitions, and decision-making in partnerships. Work may be individual or joint.</p>
          </div>

          <div class='spec'>
            <strong>Work stress & boundaries</strong>
            <p class='muted'>Strategies to manage overwhelm, set limits, and recover from burnout without sacrificing priorities.</p>
          </div>

          <div class='spec'>
            <strong>Recurring patterns</strong>
            <p class='muted'>Understanding repeated cycles in relationships, mood, or behavior and practicing experiments to shift them.</p>
          </div>

          <div class='spec'>
            <strong>Transitions & decisions</strong>
            <p class='muted'>Focused sessions to clarify choices and support transitions—career moves, caregiving changes, or relocations.</p>
          </div>

          <div class='spec'>
            <strong>Loss & meaning</strong>
            <p class='muted'>Support for grieving, ambiguous loss, and reorganizing meaning after change.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class='spec'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Quick selector</div>
          <div class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>Pick the phrase that fits and see a tailored suggestion.</div>
          <div class='mood-mini' role='list' aria-label='Mood pills' style='margin-top:12px'>
            <button class='pill' data-key='overwhelmed'>Overwhelmed</button>
            <button class='pill' data-key='stuck'>Stuck</button>
            <button class='pill' data-key='grieving'>Grieving</button>
          </div>

          <div class='recommend' id='specRec' aria-live='polite'>Select a pill to see a suggestion.</div>

          <a id='specCta' class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='display:inline-block;margin-top:12px'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>

          <div class='accordion' style='margin-top:14px'>
            <div class='acc-head' id='sbHead'>Session boundaries & confidentiality <span aria-hidden='true'>+</span></div>
            <div class='acc-body' id='sbBody'>
              <p>I keep clinical records and will discuss confidentiality and its limits at intake. If your needs include emergency or inpatient care, I will help with referrals. This practice is not a 24/7 crisis service.</p>
              <p style='margin-top:8px'>If you are in immediate danger, call emergency services. If in the United States, the 988 Lifeline is a resource for immediate support.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style='margin-top:18px'>
      <div class='spec'>
        <h3>How to choose</h3>
        <p class='muted'>If you are looking for brief, actionable work, ask about a targeted series. If you want to explore deeper patterns, consider a longer block. I will help match structure to your goals during our first conversation.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style='max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:0 20px;color:var(--muted)'>Contact for scheduling: {{PHONE}} • {{EMAIL}}. If you are in crisis, please call emergency services or 988 in the United States for immediate help.</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    (function(){
      var map = {
        'overwhelmed':{text:'Short blocks focused on stabilization and pacing — skills you can use between sessions',label:'Request a stabilization block'},
        'stuck':{text:'Blocks that mix reflection with behavioral experiments to open stuck cycles',label:'Plan a pattern-focused series'},
        'grieving':{text:'Sessions that hold loss and help navigate practical tasks while tending to meaning',label:'Schedule a supportive session'}
      };
      document.querySelectorAll('.pill').forEach(function(b){
        b.addEventListener('click',function(){
          var key = b.getAttribute('data-key');
          var val = map[key];
          document.getElementById('specRec').textContent = val.text;
          var url='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}';
          try{var nu=new URL(url,location.href);nu.searchParams.set('focus',key);document.getElementById('specCta').setAttribute('href',nu.toString());}catch(e){document.getElementById('specCta').setAttribute('href',url);}        
          document.getElementById('specCta').textContent = val.label + ' — ' + '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
        });
      });

      var head = document.getElementById('sbHead');
      var body = document.getElementById('sbBody');
      head.addEventListener('click',function(){
        var open = body.style.display === 'block';
        body.style.display = open ? 'none' : 'block';
        head.querySelector('span').textContent = open ? '+' : '-';
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'/>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'/>
  <title>Method & Process — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f7f9fc;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#4b5563;--accent:#7c3aed}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;background:var(--bg);color:#071233}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 20px;background:white;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff}
    .logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed,#2563eb);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:26px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .lead{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.04)}
    .lead h1{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}
    .method{padding:16px;background:var(--card);border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #f1f5f9}
    .step{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start}
    .num{width:36px;height:36px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .accordion{margin-top:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eef2ff}
    .acc-head{padding:12px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #f8fafc;cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
    .acc-body{padding:12px;display:none;color:var(--muted)}
    @media(max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style='display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center'>
      <div class='logo'>MP</div>
      <div>
        <div style='font-weight:700'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style='font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)'>Care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label='Primary navigation'>
      <a href='index.html'>Welcome</a>
      <a href='about.html'>Background</a>
      <a href='specialties.html'>Focus</a>
      <a href='approach.html' style='color:#071233;font-weight:700'>Method</a>
      <a href='book.html'>Book</a>
      <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class='lead'>
      <h1>How we can work together</h1>
      <p class='muted'>I match structure to the question: brief, skills-oriented plans for immediate relief; exploratory work to understand patterns; or a blend of both. Below you'll find the practical steps I usually follow and a live selector to help pick a starting point.</p>
    </div>

    <div class='grid'>
      <div>
        <div class='method'>
          <h3>Typical flow</h3>
          <div style='height:8px'></div>
          <div class='step'><div class='num'>1</div><div><strong>First contact</strong><div class='muted' style='margin-top:6px'>A brief call or message to clarify needs and logistics. We decide together whether a single session, a short series, or a referral is most appropriate.</div></div></div>
          <div style='height:10px'></div>
          <div class='step'><div class='num'>2</div><div><strong>Intake & plan</strong><div class='muted' style='margin-top:6px'>The first session includes a compact assessment and a co-created plan with measurable aims when helpful.</div></div></div>
          <div style='height:10px'></div>
          <div class='step'><div class='num'>3</div><div><strong>Work phase</strong><div class='muted' style='margin-top:6px'>Sessions may include skill practice, reflection, and small experiments between meetings. We review progress regularly and adjust pace.</div></div></div>
          <div style='height:10px'></div>
          <div class='step'><div class='num'>4</div><div><strong>Wrap & next steps</strong><div class='muted' style='margin-top:6px'>When goals are met or it's time to pause, we close a block intentionally and plan follow-up if needed.</div></div></div>

          <div style='margin-top:14px'>
            <label style='font-weight:700'>Mood-to-Method selector</label>
            <select id='moodMethod' style='display:block;margin-top:8px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #eef2ff'>
              <option value='urgent'>Need immediate coping tools</option>
              <option value='clarify'>Need help clarifying a decision</option>
              <option value='patterns'>Want to explore repeated patterns</option>
              <option value='support'>Need supportive space for loss</option>
            </select>
            <div id='methodRec' class='muted' style='margin-top:10px'>Choose a state to see a suggested structure.</div>

            <div style='margin-top:12px'>
              <a id='methodCta' class='btn' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class='accordion' style='margin-top:12px'>
          <div class='acc-head' id='boundHead'>Session boundaries & confidentiality <span aria-hidden='true'>+</span></div>
          <div class='acc-body' id='boundBody'>
            <p>I document details needed for continuity of care and billing. Confidentiality is maintained within legal limits; I will explain these limits during intake and in writing. I do not provide emergency intervention, and I will discuss referrals if urgent care is appropriate.</p>
            <p style='margin-top:8px'>If you are in immediate danger, call local emergency services. In the United States, dialing 988 connects you to the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class='method'>
